---
<Base
  title="EICR for Leeds Landlords: 2026 Rules, Costs, Fines"
  description="Landlords in England need an EICR every 5 years, with fines up to £30,000 for skipping it. A Leeds electrician explains the 2026 rules, real costs, and what the codes on the report mean."
  current="/blog/"
